---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="foot">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="foot__status">
      NCBO is a Pennsylvania nonprofit corporation in formation. We intend to apply for 501(c)(3)
      status; that status has not been granted, and contributions are not tax-deductible.
    </p>
    <p class="foot__pre">
      The first NCBO season has not started. Standings, schedule and scoring shown here describe how
      competition will work when it does — no result on this site is a real result.
    </p>
    <ul class="foot__links">
      <li><a href="/how-standing-works">How standing works</a></li>
      <li><a href="/resources/health">Health &amp; wellbeing</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://thencbo.org/">Main site</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p class="foot__copy">&copy; {year} National Collegiate Bodybuilding Organization</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .foot {
    background: var(--bg-band);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-top: 4rem;
    padding-block: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }
  .foot__status,
  .foot__pre {
    max-width: 70ch;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .foot__links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }
  .foot__copy {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
</style>
